---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Customer Reviews — Orbit Web Designs & Marketing" description="Real reviews from Kenyan businesses that chose Orbit for web design, e-commerce, and digital marketing.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-24">
    <header class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric mb-4">■ Social Proof</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6">What Our Clients Say</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Real results from Kenyan businesses that trusted us with their digital presence.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="reveal card-shine glow-border edge-glow p-8 hover-lift">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-electric text-xl">★★★★★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Orbit delivered our barbershop website in 5 days. Online booking cut phone calls by 80% and no-shows dropped to near zero. The M-Pesa integration works flawlessly."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-electric/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-bold text-electric">GK</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">George Kamau</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Owner, Genthub Barbershop</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal card-shine glow-border edge-glow p-8 hover-lift" style="transition-delay: 100ms">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-electric text-xl">★★★★★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Our farm-to-door grocery store went live in 3 weeks. M-Pesa checkout increased conversions by 40%. The inventory dashboard saves us hours every week."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-electric/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-bold text-electric">AM</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">Aisha Mwangi</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Founder, Sokoni Fresh</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal card-shine glow-border edge-glow p-8 hover-lift" style="transition-delay: 200ms">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-electric text-xl">★★★★★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Our artisan storefront tripled wholesale inquiries in two months. The team understood our brand and delivered a site that actually converts visitors into wholesale buyers."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-electric/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-bold text-electric">WN</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">Wanjiku Njoroge</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Founder, Zawadi Crafts</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal card-shine glow-border edge-glow p-8 hover-lift" style="transition-delay: 300ms">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-electric text-xl">★★★★★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Property listings with one-tap WhatsApp viewing requests cut our response time from hours to minutes. More viewings, faster closings."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-electric/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-bold text-electric">PK</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">Peter Kinyua</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Director, Tatu Heights</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal card-shine glow-border edge-glow p-8 hover-lift" style="transition-delay: 400ms">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-electric text-xl">★★★★★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Our restaurant's digital menu and reservation system cut phone traffic by 70%. Updates take minutes, not days. Best investment we made."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-electric/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-bold text-electric">MO</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">Mama Oliech</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Owner, Mama Oliech Restaurant</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal card-shine glow-border edge-glow p-8 hover-lift" style="transition-delay: 500ms">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-electric text-xl">★★★★★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">"Single-page fitness landing page with membership signups and class schedules. Conversion rate doubled compared to our old site. Simple, fast, effective."</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-electric/20 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="font-bold text-electric">FN</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">Felix Njoroge</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Owner, FitZone Gym</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <p class="text-slate-400 mb-6">Want results like these? <a href="/contact" class="text-electric hover:underline">Start your project</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>